WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:48.771
Fork the First Artist is open-source artist tooling built around public-fact AI previews and activation by an artist's own key. A preview or an artist card is not the same thing as activation. For tipping, the fan uses their own wallet and reviews the transfer before signing. The current published model sends ninety-six point three one percent of an artist tip to the artist and three point six nine percent to steward compute, with zero percent to the Open Source Orchestra itself. At the time this narration was researched, both mainnet and practice testnet modes were enabled, but the public configuration is checked afresh and can change. Real transfers are public and irreversible, require gas, and are not DAO custody or a promised return. Never share a seed phrase. Check the artist, network, token, amount and full addresses yourself.
